# GuitarFreaks 8th Mix power-up ver. joining DrumMania 7th Mix power-up ver.'s session (with drmn7m-session, which hosts the
# multi-session unit). From what gtrfrk8m-install left: NOTE 605 (Test), then two coins and Start during
# the DrumMania cabinet's WELCOME (its joining period), Start every 300 frames through the shared
# mode and music select; the first stage, SESSION on the guitar's screen.
game gtrfrk8m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 900 press "Service Mode" 8
at 13400 press "Coin 1" 8
at 13450 press "Coin 1" 8
at 13550 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 13700 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 12000 every 300 snap
at 21000 quit
